<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-UAE BEAT ROMANIA 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UAE BEAT ROMANIA 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates beat Romania 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in a soccer friendly on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Romania - Ion Vladoiu (60th min)</p>
<p>United Arab Emirates - Abdulrazaq Ibrahim Hussein Al Bolooshi (5th), Zuhair Bokhit Belal Saeed (71st)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
